   "text": "Layout only, no colors: layout B, at 1280 × 720 (the smallest window), paused, on the first visit, then with each menu open.\nThe large screen (1920 × 1080) comes once this layout is agreed. Double-click a block to edit it, Ctrl+Shift+G to ungroup.",
